{"text": "The forest was full of trees, bushes, and shadows. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Stripy shadows, spotty shadows, and patchy shadows were everywhere. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The sun was shining through the leaves in little pieces. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The animals lived there for a long, long time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Slowly, they began to change color. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Giraffe got big blotches, and the Zebra got stripes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Other animals became darker, like the bark of the trees. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Now they were much harder to see than before. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Meanwhile, the Leopard and the hunter were still on the High Veldt. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They looked everywhere, but there was nothing to eat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They ate rats and beetles, and they both got stomachaches.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "f", "o", "r", "e", "s", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "f", "u", "l", "l", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "r", "e", "e", "s", ",", " ", "b", "u", "s", "h", "e", "s", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "h", "a", "d", "o", "w", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "t", "r", "i", "p", "y", " ", "s", "h", "a", "d", "o", "w", "s", ",", " ", "s", "p", "o", "t", "t", "y", " ", "s", "h", "a", "d", "o", "w", "s", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "p", "a", "t", "c", "h", "y", " ", "s", "h", "a", "d", "o", "w", "s", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "e", "v", "e", "r", "y", "w", "h", "e", "r", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "s", "u", "n", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "s", "h", "i", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "h", "r", "o", "u", "g", "h", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "l", "e", "a", "v", "e", "s", " ", "i", "n", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "p", "i", "e", "c", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", 